1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,000
Every day in Basey, thousands of rides on tricycles and habal-habal begin with one question: how much is the fare?

2
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:15,000
Without a shared guide, riders guess, drivers and passengers argue, discounts get skipped, and overcharging leaves no proof.

3
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:22,000
Introducing Basey FareCheck, the municipality's fare guide, built on Municipal Ordinance No. 105, Series of 2023.

4
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:29,500
Pick where you're going. FareCheck measures your trip by real roads, not a straight line,

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:37,000
and shows the exact fare approved by the Sangguniang Bayan, the same number your driver sees.

6
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:48,000
Students, seniors and persons with disability get twenty percent off automatically. Scan the permit QR to log your trip, and report overcharging with photo evidence.

7
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:55,000
It's grounded in law. The Local Government Code empowers the Sangguniang Bayan to regulate tricycles for hire,

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,000
and Ordinance 105, enacted unanimously on July 3, 2023, sets the fares FareCheck applies.

9
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:08,000
Only the Sangguniang Bayan may set fares, after a public hearing. Drivers must charge the approved fare and post it.

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Discounts follow national law, and your personal data is protected under the Data Privacy Act of 2012.

11
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:24,000
FareCheck enforces the ordinance and never rewrites it: verified routes only, fare changes only with an official issuance, and penalties only where the law provides.

12
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:36,000
For commuters, that means a fair price every time, the discounts you're entitled to, proof of every ride, and a voice when something goes wrong. Drivers get fewer arguments and a record of their trips.

13
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:49,000
For the municipal government: evidence-based enforcement, one shared record, instant town-wide fare updates, transparent franchise actions, and real data for planning.

14
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:56,500
Basey FareCheck. Know the fare before you ride.
